    "layer": -3,
    "movable": false,
    "movableInEdit": false,
    "css": "font-size: 25px;",
    "text": "MOVE is the one function that needs two holders at once, so it spells them out: <b>fromHolder</b> is where the widgets come from, <b>toHolder</b> is where they go. Its third input is the usual <b>target</b>, for moving widgets that are not in a holder at all. All three accept a list of widget ids or the name of a collection, and fromHolder wins over target the same way holder does everywhere else."
  },
